Dear players! Update 1.2 is out!
The main changes of this update have been requested by many, often asked us about it! We promised you, we released!
Game changes:
1. Added sounds for the beginning and end of rounds;
2. Now when the character squats, the weapon does not disappear;
3. Reloading after changing weapons does not start over;
4. Fixed a bug with the menu, when after the death of a player or at the beginning of a new round, the player could move even with the menu open;
5. Classic Paintball game mode has been added! The classic mode implies the standard rules of the game that exist in real life and have taken root for everyone who has ever played Paintball. In this mode, the view is from the character's face and he is wearing a mask, the number of cartridges is not visible, it is enough to hit the enemy 1 time so that he drops out and waits for the next round. The number of people in the match is 10, its duration is 1 minute 30 seconds, the number of rounds to choose from.

This update is released thanks to your support and feedback! Thank you for your feedback on the game, we continue to support the game and make you happy!

Dear players!
Update 1.1.5 is out! The game has the following changes:
1. The window with information about the murder now disappears immediately;
2. The grenade after the throw changes to the previous weapon, before it was possible to observe only empty hands;
3. A new mode called "Liquidation" has been released
4. Disabled the nickname input plate when starting the game;
5. Reduced brightness on the Castle map;
6. Fixed issue with displaying skins on markers;
7. The inscription in the game has been fixed, when instead of the number of kills required to win, the inscription "Please wait until the end of the round" was displayed.
This update was released with your support and your feedback! Next week after testing, the classic Paintball game mode should be released
